  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Nearl, once known as the Radiant Knight of Kazimierz, is a member of the Infected support group, 'Followers.' She has demonstrated remarkable combat techniques and military discipline, whether it's covering allies, mobile warfare, all-out assault or field battle. \nCurrently a Defender Operator for Rhodes Island and provides command and combat support in person."
